        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683669" data-guid="7683669"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683669" data-guid="7683669" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683669_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref="LF1609711"><span class="hisdate">7-18-2022</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 9.41.22</span></span>]</div><div class="para">A single platform which is mounted on wheels, designed or used in fact for riding underfoot, having no mechanism or other device with which to steer or control the direction of movement thereof while being used.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
