        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683671" data-guid="7683671"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683671" data-guid="7683671" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683671_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref="LF1609711"><span class="hisdate">7-18-2022</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 9.41.22</span></span>]</div><div class="para">No person shall use or ride a skateboard in, on, or upon any publicly owned monument, sculpture, or other statuary.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
