<div class="section_content content" id="7683676_content" title-footnotes="1"><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7683676-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7683676-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: Former § 255-10, Regulations, was repealed <span class="legref" data-ref="LF1609711"><span class="hisdate">7-18-2022</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 9.41.22</span></span>.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683679"
      id="7683679"
      data-guid="7683679"
      data-position="6055"
      data-full-title="§ 255-11: Penalties for offenses."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7683679_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7683679_label" for="7683679_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7683679"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 255-11
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7683679"
    >
Penalties for offenses.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683679" data-guid="7683679"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683679" data-guid="7683679" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683679_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7683680"><a alt="255-11A" class="litem_number" href="7683680#7683680" onclick="return false;" title="255-11A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any police officer who shall observe any person using or riding upon a skateboard in violation of this article shall take possession of the skateboard and issue a dated, written notice of such violation to such person or, if such person is under the age of 18 years, to the person and his or her parent or guardian, together with a copy of this article, and shall file a copy of such written notice with the Clerk of Albany City Court civil team.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7683681"><a alt="255-11B" class="litem_number" href="7683681#7683681" onclick="return false;" title="255-11B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">For a first offense, the skateboard shall be returned to the rider upon his or her appearance, if 18 or older, in said City Court. If the rider is under 18, it shall be returned upon the appearance of the rider and his or her parent or guardian in City Court.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7683682"><a alt="255-11C" class="litem_number" href="7683682#7683682" onclick="return false;" title="255-11C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">In the case of a second or third violation, the skateboard shall not be returned to the rider for 30 days from the date of the violation, and shall be returned at that time upon appearance of the rider in City Court or, if the rider is under 18 years of age, upon the appearance of the rider and his or her parent or guardian in City Court.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7683683"><a alt="255-11D" class="litem_number" href="7683683#7683683" onclick="return false;" title="255-11D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Upon a fourth or subsequent violation, the skateboard shall not be returned to the rider and shall be forfeited to the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
